la la la ♪

13
00:00:34,633 --> 00:00:37,500
♪ he’ll have to sit
and watch them all ♪

14
00:00:37,533 --> 00:00:40,667
♪ then we’ll monitor his mind
la la la ♪

15
00:00:40,700 --> 00:00:43,667
♪ now keep in mind
Joel can’t control ♪

16
00:00:43,700 --> 00:00:47,000
♪ where the movies begin or end
la la la ♪

17
00:00:47,033 --> 00:00:49,933
♪ because he used
those special parts ♪

18
00:00:49,967 --> 00:00:54,567
