19
00:00:54,600 --> 00:00:57,700
Robot roll call:
Cambot,

20
00:00:57,733 --> 00:00:59,067
- gypsy...
- Hi, girls.

21
00:00:59,100 --> 00:01:00,667
- ... Tom Servo...
- What a cool guy.

22
00:01:00,700 --> 00:01:02,200
